Z||000034||Big O||03-02-2000||08:18 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by stimpy:<BR><B>Gee dad, when did you go PC on me? Next you'll be huggin trees and saving the burrowing owl!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>I became PC literate when I learned how to spell the word LIABILITY correctly.<P>||||reg||1
